&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An intuitive problem-solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable turning complex ideas into actionable solutions and are enthusiastic about enhancing client experience, our delivery approach, and product effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
