&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with clients and internal stakeholders to assess project scope, establish delivery milestones, and find and resolve ambiguity before it impacts the project.&lt;/li&gt;
