&lt;div class=&quot;prose article-prose&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team and play a pivotal role in shaping the future of DataOS. DataOS is the operating system for data and documents in asset-backed lending, a $5 trillion market ripe for modernization. Our platform helps standardize, verify, and store critical data and documents in a central repository serving both borrowers and lenders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Full Stack Engineer, you will own end-to-end development of high-impact features across the stack, from design through launch. You’ll work on client-facing, mission-critical functionality, including AI-driven features that accelerate document review, streamline data verification, and ensure data integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
