&lt;ul class=&quot;pl-3 list-disc marker:text-coral&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owners&lt;/strong&gt; – You thrive when given autonomy, cutting through ambiguity and driving results without waiting for detailed requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doers&lt;/strong&gt; – You move fast, experiment, and ship great products that solve real-world problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-Focused Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; – You obsess over the user experience and build with empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Partners&lt;/strong&gt; – You’re curious, ask clarifying questions, and collaborate closely with Product and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
