&lt;div class=&quot;bg-darkerGreen text-white rounded-2xl p-4 pt-8 lg:py-14 lg:px-20 relative overflow-hidden before:absolute before:inset-x-0 before:top-0 before:h-3 before:bg-coral&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;t-24 mb-9&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pl-3 list-disc marker:text-coral&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems that streamline the parsing, standardization, and movement of complex financial data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver client-facing and high-impact features, including responsible use of AI/LLM technologies to automate workflows while maintaining quality and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Finance, and Leadership to shape our roadmap, working directly with your Tech Lead and having access to the C-Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in internal user experience: build and refine tooling that keeps the team productive and velocity high.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to clarify scope, validate client expectations, and ensure impactful delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bg-darkerGreen text-white rounded-2xl p-4 pt-8 lg:py-14 lg:px-20 relative overflow-hidden before:absolute before:inset-x-0 before:top-0 before:h-3 before:bg-coral&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;t-24 mb-9&quot;&gt;You should have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pl-3 list-disc marker:text-coral&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-stack software engineering experience with a proven track record of delivering production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in our modern tech stack, or similar: Python/Flask, TypeScript/React, Tailwind CSS, Data Warehouses, and tools for data and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience participating in a rotating on-call shift, with the ability to investigate, triage, and resolve immediate production issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong ownership mindset – you take responsibility for end-to-end initiatives and see them through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to rapidly prototype and iterate based on tight feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguous, high-autonomy environments while driving clarity and progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and practical experience with AI and LLM technologies, with a focus on their responsible use in production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills – you ask the right questions, align stakeholders, and make complex ideas clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach – you work effectively with teammates, welcome feedback, and contribute to team success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Database / Data Warehouse / Data Integrity experience is a plus – focus on auditability and version control/change tracking for critical datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
